---
import Container from "@moesegfault/style/astro/Container.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="接入指南"
  description="在 React、Astro 和无构建工具网页中接入 MoeSegFault Style。"
  currentPath="/guides/"
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <Container>
      <p class="kicker">GUIDES</p>
      <h1>从一行 CSS 开始。</h1>
      <p class="lede">不用一次搬走整间工坊。从项目需要的那一层开始：只用颜色就拿令牌，需要交互再接 React。</p>
    </Container>
  </header>

  <section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="install-title">
    <Container>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Install</p><h2 id="install-title">包管理器接入</h2></div>
      </div>
      <CodeBlock label="Terminal" code="pnpm add @moesegfault/style" />
      <div class="guide-grid">
        <article class="guide-card">
          <h3>React / TypeScript</h3>
          <p>先安装 <code>react</code> 与 <code>react-dom</code> 19+，再在应用入口加载一次 CSS，并按需导入组件。</p>
          <CodeBlock
            label="src/App.tsx"
            code={`import "@moesegfault/style/all.css";\nimport { Button, Notice } from "@moesegfault/style/react";\n\nexport function App() {\n  return <Notice title="你好"><Button>继续</Button></Notice>;\n}`}
          />
        </article>
        <article class="guide-card">
          <h3>Astro</h3>
          <p>Astro 组件默认输出静态 HTML，不需要客户端 JavaScript。</p>
          <CodeBlock
            label="src/pages/index.astro"
            code={`---\nimport "@moesegfault/style/all.css";\nimport Button from "@moesegfault/style/astro/Button.astro";\nimport Card from "@moesegfault/style/astro/Card.astro";\n---\n<Card><h2>静态优先</h2><Button href="/start">开始</Button></Card>`}
          />
        </article>
        <article class="guide-card">
          <h3>Astro + React island</h3>
          <p>只对确实需要交互的组件添加客户端指令（client directive）。</p>
          <CodeBlock
            label="src/pages/chat.astro"
            code={`---\nimport { Composer } from "../components/Composer";\n---\n<Composer client:visible />`}
          />
        </article>
        <article class="guide-card">
          <h3>分层 CSS</h3>
          <p>全量入口最省心；对尺寸敏感时可以明确选择层级。</p>
          <CodeBlock
            label="src/styles/app.css"
            code={`@import "@moesegfault/style/tokens.css";\n@import "@moesegfault/style/foundation.css";\n@import "@moesegfault/style/components.css";`}
          />
        </article>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cdn-title">
    <Container>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">No build</p><h2 id="cdn-title">CDN / 原生 HTML</h2></div>
        <p>固定版本用于生产；latest 仅适合原型、文档预览或受控的自动更新场景。</p>
      </div>
      <CodeBlock
        label="index.html"
        code={`<!doctype html>\n<html lang="zh-CN">\n  <head>\n    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://style.moesegfault.dev/v0.1.2/css/all.css">\n  </head>\n  <body class="moe-surface">\n    <button class="moe-button">开始创作</button>\n  </body>\n</html>`}
      />
      <div class="callout">
        <h3>主题初始化</h3>
        <p>在首屏样式计算前设置 <code>data-moe-theme</code>，可以避免主题闪烁；这间工坊的文档页就采用该方式。</p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="rich-text-guide-title"><Container>
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Markdown + TeX</p><h2 id="rich-text-guide-title">把笔记与公式也带上</h2></div></div>
    <p>React 富文本使用独立入口，普通交互组件无需带上解析器；Astro 可以直接输出静态 HTML。用 String.raw 保留 TeX 反斜杠，避免它们被 JavaScript 字符串转义。</p>
    <div class="guide-grid">
      <article class="guide-card"><h3>React</h3><CodeBlock language="tsx" label="notes.tsx" code={"import \"@moesegfault/style/all.css\";\nimport { Markdown, Math } from \"@moesegfault/style/react/rich-text\";\n\nconst note = String.raw`## Notes\n\nEuler: $e^{i\\pi}+1=0$`;\n\n<Markdown content={note} />;\n<Math tex={String.raw`\\sum_{k=1}^{n} k`} display />;"} /></article>
      <article class="guide-card"><h3>Astro</h3><CodeBlock language="astro" label="notes.astro" code={"---\nimport Markdown from \"@moesegfault/style/astro/Markdown.astro\";\nimport Math from \"@moesegfault/style/astro/Math.astro\";\nconst note = \"## Notes\\n\\nA little room to think.\";\n---\n<Markdown content={note} />\n<Math tex={String.raw`E = mc^2`} display />"} /></article>
    </div>
  </Container></section>
</DocsLayout>
